{"ref":"BDB, הֲדָרָה","hw":"הֲדָרָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">הֲדָרָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. adornment, glory</strong>—only cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַדְרַת</span>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳־קֹדֶשׁ</span> <em>holy adornment</em> (Che ψ), always in connexion with public worship of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.29\">1 Ch 16:29</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.21\">2 Ch 20:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:2\" href=\"/Psalms.29.2\">ψ 29:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 96:9\" href=\"/Psalms.96.9\">96:9</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳־מֶלֶךְ</span> <em>the glory of a king</em>, fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">רָב־עַם</span>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.28\">Pr 14:28</a>.","next":"BDB, הֲדַר","prev":"BDB, הָדָר"}